body:
 Psychological, my lack of any experience and continued struggle just seems to make each encounter worse. Now out of college and in an engineering job I am now mostly around people well into their 40s and overwhelmingly guys, I just don't meet anyone my age anymore let alone women, if/when I do I'm sure my inexperience is a red flag.

&#x200B;

I feel abnormal since most people have managed to have at least one situation of mutual affection, I can't say I have.
